WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.007 --> 00:00:25.153
"What a mess!" Mrs. Tiggywinkle said.

2
00:00:25.154 --> 00:00:27.959
Peter and Benjamin looked up.

3
00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:31.291
"Mrs. Tiggywinkle!" Peter said.

4
00:00:31.292 --> 00:00:38.743
"You're back!" Benjamin said.

5
00:00:38.744 --> 00:00:48.062
Mrs. Tiggywinkle put on her apron and cap.

6
00:00:48.063 --> 00:00:51.569
"Benjamin, mop this floor.

7
00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:53.861
Peter, pick up that laundry.

8
00:00:53.862 --> 00:00:59.017
I will show you how to wash clothes."

9
00:00:59.018 --> 00:01:08.648
First, Mrs. Tiggywinkle heated some water.

10
00:01:08.649 --> 00:01:11.449
Next, she put in some soap.

11
00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:17.391
"Just a little bit," she said.

12
00:01:17.392 --> 00:01:21.036
"Now it's time to scrub."

13
00:01:21.037 --> 00:01:28.853
The bunnies scrubbed the clothes.

14
00:01:28.854 --> 00:01:32.315
They hung them on a line.

15
00:01:32.316 --> 00:01:35.082
"All clean!" Peter said.

16
00:01:35.083 --> 00:01:38.793
"Let's go play!" Benjamin said.

17
00:01:38.794 --> 00:01:41.186
Mrs. Tiggywinkle frowned.

18
00:01:41.187 --> 00:01:44.221
"Not yet," she said.

19
00:01:44.222 --> 00:01:53.264
"We must wash Flopsy's red dress first."

20
00:01:53.265 --> 00:01:59.602
At last all the laundry was done.

21
00:01:59.603 --> 00:02:02.651
The house was clean.

22
00:02:02.652 --> 00:02:16.620
"Now you can play," Mrs. Tiggywinkle said.

23
00:02:16.621 --> 00:02:24.009
Peter and Benjamin walked home slowly.

24
00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:27.569
They got Benjamin's kite.

25
00:02:27.570 --> 00:02:35.311
Then they went to a field.

26
00:02:35.312 --> 00:02:40.101
Benjamin yawned.

27
00:02:40.102 --> 00:02:43.807
"You can fly the kite first," he said.

28
00:02:43.808 --> 00:02:51.344
But Peter was snoring!

29
00:02:51.345 --> 00:03:00.207
Soon Benjamin was snoring too.
